* Transistor models used for the NA522-compatible phono card simulations.
* These are representative Gummel-Poon parameter sets (derived from the
* commonly-distributed Philips/NXP BC547C/BC557C-family models, with base
* spreading resistance raised to realistic small-signal values for noise work).
* REVIEWER NOTE: substitute manufacturer models (Diotec/CDIL BC550C/BC560C,
* Nexperia BC850C/BC860C, Nexperia/Diodes BCX56-16) for sign-off.
*
* BC550C / BC850C (same die family, low-noise NPN, hFE group C 420..800)
.model BC550C NPN(IS=7.049E-15 BF=520 NF=0.9932 VAF=62.79 IKF=0.08 ISE=6.8E-15 NE=1.58
+ BR=7.5 NR=0.9931 VAR=11.42 IKR=0.12 ISC=1.2E-14 NC=1.2 RB=120 IRB=2E-5 RBM=40
+ RE=0.66 RC=0.9 XTB=1.5 EG=1.11 XTI=3 CJE=1.25E-11 VJE=0.65 MJE=0.33 TF=6.4E-10
+ XTF=2 VTF=10 ITF=0.3 CJC=4.5E-12 VJC=0.55 MJC=0.33 TR=5E-8 KF=2E-16 AF=1 FC=0.5)
.model BC850C NPN(IS=7.049E-15 BF=520 NF=0.9932 VAF=62.79 IKF=0.08 ISE=6.8E-15 NE=1.58
+ BR=7.5 NR=0.9931 VAR=11.42 IKR=0.12 ISC=1.2E-14 NC=1.2 RB=120 IRB=2E-5 RBM=40
+ RE=0.66 RC=0.9 XTB=1.5 EG=1.11 XTI=3 CJE=1.25E-11 VJE=0.65 MJE=0.33 TF=6.4E-10
+ XTF=2 VTF=10 ITF=0.3 CJC=4.5E-12 VJC=0.55 MJC=0.33 TR=5E-8 KF=2E-16 AF=1 FC=0.5)
*
* BC560C / BC860C (low-noise PNP, hFE group C)
.model BC560C PNP(IS=1.02E-14 BF=480 NF=0.9932 VAF=52 IKF=0.07 ISE=1E-14 NE=1.6
+ BR=7 NR=0.99 VAR=10 IKR=0.1 ISC=1E-14 NC=1.2 RB=100 IRB=2E-5 RBM=40 RE=0.6 RC=1
+ XTB=1.5 EG=1.11 XTI=3 CJE=1.5E-11 VJE=0.65 MJE=0.35 TF=6.5E-10 XTF=2 VTF=10 ITF=0.3
+ CJC=9E-12 VJC=0.5 MJC=0.35 TR=5E-8 KF=2E-16 AF=1 FC=0.5)
.model BC860C PNP(IS=1.02E-14 BF=480 NF=0.9932 VAF=52 IKF=0.07 ISE=1E-14 NE=1.6
+ BR=7 NR=0.99 VAR=10 IKR=0.1 ISC=1E-14 NC=1.2 RB=100 IRB=2E-5 RBM=40 RE=0.6 RC=1
+ XTB=1.5 EG=1.11 XTI=3 CJE=1.5E-11 VJE=0.65 MJE=0.35 TF=6.5E-10 XTF=2 VTF=10 ITF=0.3
+ CJC=9E-12 VJC=0.5 MJC=0.35 TR=5E-8 KF=2E-16 AF=1 FC=0.5)
*
* BCX56-16 (SOT-89, 80 V, 1 A, hFE 100..250) - used for followers/current sinks in Design 2
.model BCX56 NPN(IS=1.8E-13 BF=170 NF=1 VAF=120 IKF=0.8 ISE=1.5E-13 NE=1.6 BR=10 NR=1
+ VAR=20 IKR=0.3 ISC=2E-13 NC=1.3 RB=8 RBM=2 RE=0.08 RC=0.15 XTB=1.5 EG=1.11 XTI=3
+ CJE=8E-11 VJE=0.75 MJE=0.35 TF=8E-10 XTF=3 VTF=20 ITF=1 CJC=2.2E-11 VJC=0.6
+ MJC=0.4 TR=4E-8 KF=1E-16 AF=1 FC=0.5)
